' --- manual: everything below this line is hand-authored; the script preserves it ---

' The automated pass reads data members and nothing else. It drops every
' method, every static member and every using alias; it drops a declaration
' that wraps onto a second line; and it drops facets that hold only free
' functions or constants, because a namespace with no type in it is skipped
' wholesale. A request struct therefore arrives as a box holding its data
' fields but not the response type it pairs with or the subject it travels
' on, auth_session_service arrives with its private state and no behaviour,
' and the generators, the entity_type_of overloads and the event-subject
' namespaces do not arrive at all.
'
' The blocks below fill those boxes and draw the relationships the automated
' pass cannot see. They use fully-qualified class names rather than a
' reopened namespace block, because this PlantUML version crashes when a
' namespace that already holds classes is declared a second time.
' Redeclaring a class merges its members into the box the automated pass
' already drew, so a refresh keeps both halves.
'
' The component is a header-only contract whose surface is mostly message
' schemas. Three facets are drawn in full below because the
' automated pass loses them completely -- the request statics, the
' event-subject namespaces, and the free functions (generators,
' entity_type_of, the two traits specialisations). The uniform per-entity
' boilerplate that the pass also loses -- the four equality operators, the
' convert_to_table, convert_to_json and ostream overloads -- is stated in a
' note instead of drawn, because it repeats one shape eleven times.

